      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اعاقهُ</span></b> : see 1, first sentence. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَعُوَقَ بِىَ الدَّابَّةُ</span>,
or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الزَّادُ</span>, <i>The beast,</i> or <i>the travelling-provision,</i> [<i>by
failing me,</i>] <i>disabled me from prosecuting my
journey;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَطَعَ</span>. (Ibn-'Abbád, O, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَعْوَقَ عَنِّى</span> <i>It caused me to be in difficulty</i>
(<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَعْوَصَنِى</span>), <i>so that I was unable to accomplish it.</i>
(Ibn-'Abbád, O.)

